				D.
				34.28
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὰ εἰς κρίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					555b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>commend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τινα</span>”
